$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=holzfaclem  LOC_AFTER=?

* The induction step of the factorisation over the zeros of a holomorphic function on a rectangle: a factorisation over a subset S of the zero set extends to one over S with one more zero Q adjoined, the multiplicity of Q coming from the local factorisation ~ holnfac2 of the cofactor.

